---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About The Setup Vault"
	description="What The Setup Vault is, who runs it, how to contact us, and how the site is funded."
	pubDate={new Date('July 19 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		The Setup Vault is a resource for people building out a functional, comfortable home
		office — whether that's a first-time setup or a long overdue upgrade. We write practical,
		specific buying guides and comparisons for desk gear: stands, lighting, cable management,
		monitor setups, and the smaller accessories that make a workspace actually work well.
	</p>

	<p>
		Our goal with every article is to give you a genuinely useful, complete answer — not
		filler. We aim to cover real tradeoffs, honest limitations, and the specific details that
		actually matter when you're deciding what to buy.
	</p>

	<h2>Who runs this site</h2>

	<p>
		The Setup Vault is run by Teza Simulunga, its founder, based in Lusaka, Zambia. For
		questions, corrections or feedback, email
		<a href="mailto:tezatronics@gmail.com">tezatronics@gmail.com</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>How this site is funded</h2>

	<p>
		The Setup Vault does not currently use affiliate links, and nothing on this site is a paid
		placement. Some pages link to our own paid guides, which we make and sell ourselves. If that
		changes, we will say so here and mark any affiliate links clearly.
	</p>

	<h2>Analytics</h2>

	<p>
		This site uses Vercel Web Analytics to understand which pages people visit and how they
		find us. Per Vercel's documentation, this analytics is cookieless and only stores
		anonymized, aggregated data — no personal information is collected.
	</p>
</Layout>
